{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This\u00a0is\u00a0a\u00a0topdown\u00a0shooting\u00a0action\u00a0game\u00a0.player\u00a0is\u00a0a\u00a0hard\u00a0working\u00a0office\u00a0man\u00a0who\u00a0need\u00a0to\u00a0survive\u00a0the\u00a0zombies\u00a0attacts\u00a0and\u00a0finish\u00a0his\u00a0daily\u00a0document\u00a0task\u00a0using\u00a0his\u00a0computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0main\u00a0goal\u00a0is\u00a0to\u00a0be\u00a0the\u00a0best\u00a0employee\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0year\u00a0and\u00a0retire\u00a0\u00a0with\u00a0honor\u00a0from\u00a0this\u00a0company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily\u00a0task\u00a0is\u00a0assigned\u00a0through\u00a0playerComputer,and\u00a0most\u00a0of\u00a0them\u00a0is\u00a0office\u00a0typing\u00a0and\u00a0documantary\u00a0editing\u00a0works\u00a0that\u00a0can\u00a0be\u00a0done\u00a0digitally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player\u00a0get\u00a0pay\u00a0every\u00a0season.he\u00a0will\u00a0have\u00a0a\u00a0chance\u00a0to\u00a0get\u00a0salary\u00a0rise\u00a0base\u00a0on\u00a0the\u00a0kpis\u00a0of\u00a0last\u00a0season</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Player fullfill the KPIs,he may have a chance to win the &quot;Employee of the Year&quot; Award and Get a better Pay Rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As\u00a0player\u00a0earns\u00a0more\u00a0invome.he\u00a0can\u00a0buy\u00a0more\u00a0ammo\u00a0and\u00a0mount\u00a0around\u00a0his\u00a0desk\u00a0to\u00a0illiminate\u00a0zombie\u00a0more\u00a0effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Player works for the Company for 35 years and didn't Get Fired,He will  retire with Glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Manual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Move:WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Attack:Left Mouse Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Open MyPC:SPACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Interact: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659960?t=1763103127","background_raw"